### Changes Made:

**`src/auth.py`**
- Updated `has_permission` to compare roles case-insensitively using `.lower()`.
- Changed `is_admin_or_owner` logic from `and` to `or` to grant access if the user is either an admin OR the owner.

**`src/inventory.py`**
- Fixed `Inventory.__init__` to avoid using a mutable default dictionary (`{}`), preventing shared state between instances.
- Modified `Inventory.add` to increment stock (`+=`) instead of replacing it.
- Updated `Inventory.reserve` to allow reservations where `qty == available`, raising `OutOfStock` only when `qty > available`.

**`src/text_utils.py`**
- Updated `slugify` to lowercase the result and use `re.sub` to collapse all repeated separators (not just double dashes).
- Fixed `truncate` to subtract the suffix length from `max_len` when slicing, ensuring the total length remains within the limit.

